      "filename": "Fires in Portugal (MODIS 2017-07-01).jpg",
      "title": "File:Fires in Portugal (MODIS 2017-07-01).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/Fires_in_Portugal_%28MODIS_2017-07-01%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
